### --- Hidden Files & Directories ---
# Ignore all hidden files and folders (starting with a dot)
.*

# Allow specific hidden files/folders if needed
!.gitignore
# !.github/  <-- Uncomment if you use GitHub Actions

### --- Dependency Management ---
# Keep Pipfiles even if you have a blanket '.*' or other rules
!Pipfile
!Pipfile.lock

### --- Temporary & Output Files ---
*.out
*.trr
*.pyc
*#
*.pkl

### --- Folders & Patterns ---
# Ignore folders starting with rerun_
rerun_*/

# Ignore __pycache__ directories anywhere in the project
**/__pycache__/
